### Cadastro (o Identity gera o hash da senha)
POST {{Reservae_HostAddress}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@example.com",
  "password": "Teste123!"
}

### Login: copie o accessToken retornado para a variavel acima
POST {{Reservae_HostAddress}}/auth/login?useCookies=false
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@example.com",
  "password": "Teste123!"
}

### Usuario autenticado (sem token deve retornar 401)
GET {{Reservae_HostAddress}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

